title: ShivPrasad_Day4a
tags:
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite HutInterior>>

Raju commits to intensive academic focus. Cricket time dramatically reduced to prove dedication to studies above all else.

The transformation is apparent. Raju's bat remains untouched while textbooks spread everywhere. His commitment creates intense concentration that both impresses and concerns his father. The sacrifice demonstrates genuine readiness.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Quizzical">>
Shiv Prasad: I see you've been studying for hours every day, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Smiling">>
Shiv Prasad: Your discipline is remarkable.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Worried">>
Shiv Prasad: But tell me - do you miss cricket? Are you struggling without it?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Sad">>
Raju: I miss it terribly, Baba.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: But this sacrifice helps me understand how much both mean to me.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I want to earn the right to have both.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Smiling">>
Shiv Prasad: Your sacrifice shows real character, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Proud">>
Shiv Prasad: Perhaps you're more mature than I gave you credit for.


