Raju maintains cricket passion while channeling that energy and confidence into intensive academic preparation.

High energy fills both cricket practice and math study. The sustainability remains questionable as days progress. His belief that cricket success fuels academics faces practical tests - can enthusiasm substitute for methodical work? His father observes with growing concern.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Quizzical">>
Shiv Prasad: You seem energized by your cricket practice, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Skeptical">>
Shiv Prasad: But I need to see this energy actually helping your mathematics.

<<SetCharacterExpression "ShivPrasad" "Serious">>
Shiv Prasad: Not just making you feel good, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: It is helping, Baba!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: After good cricket practice, I study with more focus.

